1
00:00:03,088 --> 00:00:04,978
Hello, nice to meet you.

2
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:07,592
Why are you smiling?

3
00:00:07,874 --> 00:00:09,514
Oh, we're not supposed
to smile?

4
00:00:09,548 --> 00:00:13,513
I'm new at this funeral thing,
I don't know how it works.

5
00:00:13,546 --> 00:00:16,299
-What should I do?
-You must look sad.

6
00:00:17,754 --> 00:00:20,531
No... Not that sad.

7
00:00:20,564 --> 00:00:22,881
It depends on how long
you know the deceased.

8
00:00:22,915 --> 00:00:25,130
Yeah, I didn't know him.

9
00:00:25,164 --> 00:00:27,666
And I know very few people here.

10
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,680
Then just look serious.

11
00:00:31,474 --> 00:00:33,713
Something between serious
and mournful.

12
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,875
No, wait.

13
00:00:37,388 --> 00:00:38,783
Breath.

14
00:00:39,646 --> 00:00:43,078
Bend down a little
and shake your head.

15
00:00:43,112 --> 00:00:48,006
Then say something like:
"He was so young..."

16
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,092
-He was so young.
-Look, that's his son.

17
00:00:51,126 --> 00:00:52,269
Greet him.

18
00:00:52,303 --> 00:00:54,293
-Ah, his son?
-Yes.

19
00:00:56,163 --> 00:00:57,555
Brother.

20
00:00:58,307 --> 00:00:59,827
Hi, man.

21
00:01:00,382 --> 00:01:01,856
Congratulations.

22
00:01:02,888 --> 00:01:04,543
Congratulations?

23
00:01:04,577 --> 00:01:06,783
That's not it?

24
00:01:06,817 --> 00:01:09,126
Thanks. Thank you very much?

25
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:11,256
What a joy!

26
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,509
Greetings, I miss you.
"I miss you", right?

27
00:01:14,543 --> 00:01:17,847
-"My condolences."
-You too, my friend.

28
00:01:17,881 --> 00:01:18,988
Thank you.

29
00:01:19,022 --> 00:01:21,827
Sorry I didn't get you anything.
I was in such a hurry

30
00:01:21,861 --> 00:01:23,968
that I didn't even bring you
a little something.

31
00:01:24,934 --> 00:01:29,547
-Why are you laughing?
-No. I'm not laughing.

32
00:01:29,581 --> 00:01:30,813
He was so young...

33
00:01:31,487 --> 00:01:32,920
So young...

34
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:36,212
When is the speech?

35
00:01:36,246 --> 00:01:38,799
Will the father
of our guest of honor speak?

36
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:41,320
-What's your name, man?
-Manuel.

37
00:01:41,614 --> 00:01:46,715
Look, Manuel,
the guest of honor is dead.

38
00:01:47,087 --> 00:01:48,576
He's right here.

39
00:01:48,857 --> 00:01:51,706
Fuck! Is this a casket?

40
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:54,948
All the time I was touching a...
Oh, no!

41
00:01:55,155 --> 00:01:56,649
Was it contagious?

42
00:01:56,683 --> 00:02:00,226
I don't wanna die
of mortal stuff.

43
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:02,895
I thought this was the table
for the food...

44
00:02:02,929 --> 00:02:04,726
There won't be dessert, right?

45
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,970
I have a suggestion
for those who set up this... event:

46
00:02:08,004 --> 00:02:10,988
you could tell people
to have lunch beforehand,

47
00:02:11,022 --> 00:02:13,561
since there's nothing to eat.

48
00:02:13,595 --> 00:02:16,647
Me, for example.
I didn't eat and I'm starving now.

49
00:02:16,681 --> 00:02:18,774
That's rude. One more question.

50
00:02:18,808 --> 00:02:21,839
This... This little doll is him?

51
00:02:27,212 --> 00:02:29,559
What? No, man. Don't come here.

52
00:02:29,593 --> 00:02:31,598
He was already dead
when I came here.

53
00:02:31,632 --> 00:02:35,821
Yeah. No.
They didn't even offer me a beer.

54
00:02:35,855 --> 00:02:39,285
I'm telling you.
No food and no drinks.

55
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:41,718
I'm telling you. Yes?

56
00:02:42,622 --> 00:02:46,172
What? Did I hear "circumcision"?

57
00:02:46,206 --> 00:02:48,685
Oh, "appendicitis"? What is it?

58
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,109
An appendicitis party?

59
00:02:50,143 --> 00:02:53,693
We gotta go there.
There are no chicks here, man.

60
00:02:54,768 --> 00:02:56,662
Yeah, right.

61
00:02:56,696 --> 00:02:59,061
Okay.
We're stopping by Roy's, right?

62
00:02:59,095 --> 00:03:00,687
That's better. Great.

63
00:03:00,721 --> 00:03:03,309
Are you picking him up?
Me? Okay.

64
00:03:03,343 --> 00:03:06,148
See you later, champ! Monster!